  "what broke in production and how did he find it?": {
    "answer": "The LangChain deepagents SDK broke with a silent failure that produced no exception or stack trace, a failure static analysis does not catch. He found it by reading the system closely enough to see where it contradicted itself, tracing the code path that reported success while discarding an error, and writing up the defect precisely enough that a maintainer shipped the fix in 57 hours.",
